---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SWPCalculator from '../../components/calculators/SWPCalculator';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SWP Calculator | Systematic Withdrawal Plan Calculator | Ant Wealth Creation"
  description="Estimate how long your retirement corpus may last with monthly withdrawals, annual SWP step-ups and additional withdrawals."
  canonicalUrl="https://antwealth.in/tools/swp"
>
  <main class="swp-page-main">
    <!-- Breadcrumb Navigation -->
    <div class="breadcrumb-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/" class="breadcrumb-link">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <a href="/tools" class="breadcrumb-link">Calculators</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb-current">SWP Calculator</span>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="swp-header-section">
      <div class="swp-header-inner">
        <div class="swp-badge">Retirement Income & Longevity</div>
        <h1 class="swp-main-title">SWP Calculator (Regular Withdrawal Plan)</h1>
        <p class="swp-main-subtitle">
          Plan your retirement withdrawals with clarity. A Systematic Withdrawal Plan (SWP) is a way to withdraw a fixed monthly income regularly from your investments. Simulate how long your savings could last with inflation step-ups and milestone withdrawals.
        </p>

        <!-- Trust Badges Row -->
        <div class="trust-perks-row">
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">🔒</span>
            <span class="perk-text">100% Confidential</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">🛡️</span>
            <span class="perk-text">No Phone Number or Login Needed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">📉</span>
            <span class="perk-text">Monthly Withdrawal Planning</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">📈</span>
            <span class="perk-text">Inflation-Aware Step-Up</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Interactive Calculator Island -->
    <section class="calculator-container" aria-label="Interactive Systematic Withdrawal Plan Calculator">
      <SWPCalculator client:load />
    </section>

    <!-- Educational Guide Section -->
    <section class="edu-guide-section" aria-labelledby="edu-heading">
      <div class="edu-inner">
        <div class="edu-badge">Educational Guide</div>
        <h2 id="edu-heading" class="edu-title">Understanding Systematic Withdrawal Plans</h2>
        <p class="edu-intro">
          A Systematic Withdrawal Plan (SWP) allows you to withdraw a fixed amount of money from your mutual fund investments at regular intervals, providing a predictable post-retirement cash flow.
        </p>

        <div class="edu-grid">
          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">📉</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">1. How Monthly SWP Works</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Instead of withdrawing your entire retirement corpus at once or leaving it in a low-yielding savings account, an SWP redeems units monthly to meet living costs while your remaining balance continues compounding in market-linked funds.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">📈</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">2. Why Annual Step-Ups Matter</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Inflation increases the cost of living each year. An initial ₹50,000 monthly withdrawal will not have the same purchasing power 10 years later. Applying an annual step-up (e.g. 6%) keeps your retirement lifestyle protected against inflation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">🏖️</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">3. Factoring in Milestone Lumps</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Retirement involves occasional large expenses such as international travel, home renovations, vehicle purchases, or medical reserves. Scheduling lump-sum withdrawals in advance helps you test whether your corpus can sustain these shocks.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">4. Sustainable Withdrawal Rate</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Withdrawing 4% to 6% of your initial corpus per year allows your portfolio to compound and replenish itself. Withdrawing 10%+ per year can rapidly accelerate corpus depletion, especially in low-return market cycles.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross-Discovery Navigation -->
    <section class="cross-discovery-section" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
      <div class="cross-inner">
        <h2 id="tools-heading" class="cross-title">Explore Other Financial Planning Suites</h2>
        <p class="cross-subtitle">Discover comprehensive, privacy-first planning tools designed for Indian families.</p>

        <div class="cross-grid">
          <a href="/tools/retirement-distribution" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">⏳</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Retirement Distribution Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Structure your post-retirement corpus across liquidity, safety, and wealth creation buckets.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/retirement" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🌅</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Retirement Accumulation Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Calculate how much corpus you need to save before retirement and your monthly SIP roadmap.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/sip-growth" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🚀</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">SIP Growth Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">See how monthly SIPs, annual step-ups, and multiple lump-sum investments compound over time.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/home-purchase" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🏠</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Home Purchase Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Plan property appreciation, down payment, acquisition costs, and monthly EMI affordability.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/life-insurance" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🛡️</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Life Insurance Need Analysis</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Calculate your family's true term insurance protection gap factoring living expenses and debts.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/health-check/real-statement" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">💎</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">REAL Financial Statement</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Audit your income, living costs, ongoing savings, and calculate your true family net worth.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .swp-page-main {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    color: #00182A;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-container {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 0.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-link {
    color: #64748B;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .breadcrumb-link:hover {
    color: #00AB96;
  }

  .breadcrumb-sep {
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  .breadcrumb-current {
    color: #00182A;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .swp-header-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00182A 0%, #002B49 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .swp-header-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .swp-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(0, 171, 150, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 171, 150, 0.4);
    color: #00AB96;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .swp-main-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .swp-main-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem 0;
  }

  .trust-perks-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .trust-perk {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #E2E8F0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .perk-icon {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* Calculator Container */
  .calculator-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Educational Guide Section */
  .edu-guide-section {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .edu-inner {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .edu-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #00AB96;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .edu-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .edu-intro {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .edu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .edu-card {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .edu-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .edu-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .edu-card-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Cross Discovery */
  .cross-discovery-section {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .cross-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cross-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .cross-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
  }

  .cross-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .cross-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cross-card:hover {
    border-color: #00AB96;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .cross-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cross-info {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .cross-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .cross-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .cross-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #00AB96;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cross-card:hover .cross-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .swp-main-title {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
    }
    .swp-header-section {
      padding: 2.25rem 1rem 2rem;
    }
    .trust-perks-row {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .edu-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .cross-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
